WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.801
Welcome to Module 3 of the Azure Security

2
00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:06.200
Engineering learning path:
the edge and the egress.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.812
Module 2 put a web application firewall
in front of each web workload.

4
00:00:10.812 --> 00:00:13.614
This module makes sure
nothing can go around it,

5
00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:17.207
and then turns to the other
direction: traffic leaving Azure,

6
00:00:17.207 --> 00:00:22.237
through Azure Firewall, with threat
intelligence and intrusion detection denying.

7
00:00:22.237 --> 00:00:27.317
It covers Steps 5 and 6 of the Azure
Security Engineering implementation guide,

8
00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:32.140
and takes about fifty-five minutes, plus
a lab in your own test subscription.
